Subject: [PATCH] LIFECYCLE-002: Remove product participant capacity limits

Drop DB capacity constraint, stop enforcing max_participants on join,
force NULL on contest create, and remove capacity/slots UX. Load-test
and domain compile remain tracked verification gaps (not runtime-verified).
